OL,3,CUK temperatures to cool with 'chilly
OL,4,Cstart' to the weekend for many
OL,6,FTemperatures are expected to cool for
OL,7,Fparts of the UK with a chilly start to
OL,8,Fthe weekend for many, forecasters have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FIt follows days of hot and humid
OL,12,Fweather with the Met Office announcing
OL,13,Fthat England and Wales are on course
OL,14,Ffor the driest July since records
OL,15,Fbegan.
OL,17,FThe forecaster said Saturday will
OL,18,Fbring a cooler start for many, but
OL,19,Fthere will be plenty of sunny spells
OL,20,Fthrough the morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
