OL,3,CUK temperatures to cool with 'chilly
OL,4,Cstart' to the weekend for many
OL,6,FMaximum temperatures of 25-26C are
OL,7,Fpredicted and meteorologists said that
OL,8,Fwhile still warm, it will not feel as
OL,9,Fhot as recently.
OL,11,FThe Met Office said on Friday that
OL,12,FEngland and Wales are on course for
OL,13,Fthe driest July since records began.
OL,15,FIt said the month was characterised by
OL,16,Fan "exceptional combination of extreme
OL,17,Fheat, abundant sunshine and an almost
OL,18,Fcomplete absence of rainfall".
OL,26,@xD@DOUzD@]O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
