OL,3,CUK temperatures to cool with 'chilly
OL,4,Cstart' to the weekend for many
OL,6,FProvisional statistics showed that
OL,7,Fonly 5.6mm of rainfall had been
OL,8,Frecorded in England in July ` less
OL,9,Fthan half of the previous record of
OL,10,F13.4mm set in 1911.
OL,12,FWales is also set for its driest July
OL,13,Fwith 7.9mm of rainfall, almost a third
OL,14,Fof the previous record of 22.6mm also
OL,15,Fset in 1911.
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland is on track for its
OL,18,Feighth driest July while the UK as a
OL,19,Fwhole is on course for its third
OL,20,Fdriest.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
