OL,3,CUK temperatures to cool with 'chilly
OL,4,Cstart' to the weekend for many
OL,6,FScotland has had 72% of its average
OL,7,Frainfall for the month and is not
OL,8,Fcurrently within its top 10 driest
OL,9,FJulys.
OL,11,FOn Saturday, there will be showery
OL,12,Frain in the north, particularly
OL,13,FScotland, but it will be mostly dry
OL,14,Felsewhere, Met Office meteorologist
OL,15,FAlex Burkill said.
OL,17,FIn the Friday evening weather
OL,18,Fforecast, Mr Burkill said: "Many
OL,19,Fplaces, especially in the south, are
OL,20,Fcrying out for some much-needed rain.
OL,26,@zD@\OU
