OL,3,CUK temperatures to cool with 'chilly
OL,4,Cstart' to the weekend for many
OL,6,F"Whilst there's a bit of a rain on the
OL,7,Fhorizon for next week, there's not
OL,8,Fmuch to come this weekend."
OL,10,FAerial pictures taken on Friday show
OL,11,Fthe parched London landscape after
OL,12,Fweeks of hot, dry weather.
OL,14,FHalf of England and the whole of Wales
OL,15,Fis is officially in drought as
OL,16,Fsuccessive heatwaves put pressures on
OL,17,Fwater resources.
OL,19,FFirefighters have been tackling a
OL,20,Fblaze at Dunwich Heath, near Leiston,
OL,21,FSuffolk, since 5.30pm on Wednesday.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@[O]
