OL,3,CUK temperatures to cool with 'chilly
OL,4,Cstart' to the weekend for many
OL,6,FOn Friday evening, Suffolk County
OL,7,FCouncil said crews remained at the
OL,8,Fscene and "good progress is
OL,9,Fcontinuing".
OL,11,FThe wildfire is a few miles from
OL,12,Fnuclear power station Sizewell B and
OL,13,Fthe construction site for new power
OL,14,Fstation Sizewell C.
